{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And you said.</b> In your heart." "<b>[to the end etc.]</b> And it was fitting that you set these things, which I did to My people, upon your heart." "<b>You did not remember its end.</b> That of your pride, or: you did not remember what the end of My inheritance was when I was wrathful upon it."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:23.738984142Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}